femticPy patch 0006-meshgen-control-and-regions

Rationale: MeshGen hard-coded NUM_THREADS 1, no ITER_MAX, a mandatory SEA_DEPTH, the ALTITUDE file name and the earth region line (ndiv 9); expose them as attributes whose defaults reproduce upstream output.

